  "downloadPolicy": "Original release containers preserved, with three additional unchanged extracted ELFs for MCA retail, HDDChecker and PS2ME. No source archives, desktop emulator builds, commercial game data or external BIOS files downloaded. PicoDrive routes publicly to the original asset and is privately archived; it is not mirrored on the ad-supported site.",
