    "PS2Ident 0.850 ca2b5acc"
  ],
  "importantNotes": [
    "OPL themes DeckyOS 1.0 default and PadOS 1.0 normal 4:3 target OPL 1.2+. The existing stable OPL 1.1.0 remains untouched. A separately labelled OPL 1.2.0 Beta 2271 b3a2199 ELF is offered as an optional test build.",
    "Quake v1.1.0 console setup explicitly states memory-card slot1 saves, despite its README overview claiming broader save paths. The page follows the explicit console section. quake.elf is the actual filename.",
    "SuperTux USB bundle includes APPS/SUPERTUX and supertux.elf. PS2ME ZIP contains the runtime and optional background audio, plus a README in games/; no JAR games are bundled.",
    "PS2Link default build has two package files: PS2LINK.ELF and IPCONFIG.DAT. IRX modules are embedded; no separately downloaded PC client is included.",
    "Keep these scoped files distinct from other chats. No shared sidebar, console landing, sitemap, languages, i18n-tools or shared builder was edited."
  ],
  "regeneration": [
    "Run node scripts/build-ps2-expansion.cjs after any baseline PS2 regeneration; build-ps2-retro.cjs alone still produces only the original six resources.",
    "The scoped builder imports build-console-guides.cjs for the shell without running its broad build, then applies mobile/background integration.",
    "Run node scripts/prepare-ps2-expansion.cjs --download --archive with normal escalation when restaging is needed; never execute downloaded binaries. It requires Python on the unsandboxed host for read-only ZIP/TAR/ELF inspection. Existing staged files are verified and conflicting destinations are rejected.",
    "Run node scripts/verify-ps2-expansion.cjs --http against the existing 8765 preview.",
    "Use console-expansion-archive.cjs --inventory=docs/ps2-expansion-private-inventory.json --verify for cooperating union merges. Organized archive index was refreshed successfully with refresh-local-download-index.cjs --write."
  ],
